{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Type, grow, and decorate \u2013 let your plants thrive while you work!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every keystroke helps a plant grow! You can write, code, or just chat and this peaceful desktop overlay will reward you by growing your own plants during your everyday routine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a tiny sprout that grows as you type and turn it into a wonderful plant. When your screen gets crowded, move your plants to a foldable plant shelf, where they continue growing quietly in the background. Over time, you'll discover a variety of plant types! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your desktop with your favorite green companions and build your own little digital garden. Place stickers on your plants and give them names :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you're the productive type, track how much you've typed with a gentle growth-based progress system \u2013 watch your focus bloom alongside your plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669610/extras/dbf73472d13b68ab1269fa30e59b69be.poster.avif?t=1762889755\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669610/extras/dbf73472d13b68ab1269fa30e59b69be.webm?t=1762889755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669610/extras/dbf73472d13b68ab1269fa30e59b69be.mp4?t=1762889755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants grow with every keystroke </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move grown plants into a collapsible shelf to clear your screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of plants </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place stickers on plants and give them a name </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep growing plants even when they're in storage </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your desktop with your favorite green friends </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your typing activity through plant growth</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669610?t=1762889755","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669610/35127bdab89d2dd72b7ca05b2af77b41c66128a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762889755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669610/1fad54a9dbedcd9ccebc6dafd8c5c35c1428ab24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762889755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669610/1fad54a9dbedcd9ccebc6dafd8c5c35c1428ab24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762889755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Type, grow, and decorate \u2013 let your plants thrive while you work!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every keystroke helps a plant grow! You can write, code, or just chat and this peaceful desktop overlay will reward you by growing your own plants during your everyday routine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a tiny sprout that grows as you type and turn it into a wonderful plant. When your screen gets crowded, move your plants to a foldable plant shelf, where they continue growing quietly in the background. Over time, you'll discover a variety of plant types! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your desktop with your favorite green companions and build your own little digital garden. Place stickers on your plants and give them names :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you're the productive type, track how much you've typed with a gentle growth-based progress system \u2013 watch your focus bloom alongside your plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra